    "15th of Rajab\nOn the fifteenth of Rajab, offer another ten units in the same way, two at a time.\nIn each unit, recite [Surah al-Fatihah](A5) once, [Surah al-Tawheed](A116) three times and [Surah al-Kafirun](A113) three times.\nAfter the taslim, raise your hands and recite these three litanies, in this order:\nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللّٰهُ وَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ\nLAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAHU WAHDAHOO LAA SHAREEKA LAH\nThere is no god save Allah, the One and Only Who has no partner.\nلَهُ الْمُلْكُ وَلَهُ الْحَمْدُ\nLAHUL MULKU WA LAHUL HAMD\nTo Him is the kingdom and to Him is all praise.\nيُحْيِيْ وَيُمِيْتُ وَهُوَ حَيٌّ لَا يَمُوْتُ\nYUHYEE WA YUMEETU WA HUWA HAYYUN LAA YAMOOT\nHe gives life and causes to die while He is Ever-living and never dies.\nبِيَدِهِ الْخَيْرُ وَهُوَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَيْ‏ءٍ قَدِيْرٌ\nBIYADIHIL KHAYRU WA HUWA A'LAA KULLI SHAY'IN QADEER\nIn His hand is the good and He has power over all things.\nاِلَهًا وَاحِدًا اَحَدًا فَرْدًا صَمَدًا\nILAAHAN WAAHIDAN AHADAN FARDAN SAMADAA\nThe Lord Who is One, One and Only, Singular, and Besought by the all,\nلَمْ يَتَّخِذْ صَاحِبَةً وَلَا وَلَدًا\nLAM YATTAKHIDH SAAHIBATAN WA LAA WALADAA\nhas betaken neither a wife nor a son.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ لَا مَانِعَ لِمَا اَعْطَيْتَ\nALLAAHUMMA LAA MAANI'A LIMAA A'TAYT\nO Allah, verily, none can ever divest him whom You decide to give,\nوَلَا مُعْطِيَ لِمَا مَنَعْتَ\nWA LAA MU'TIYA LIMAA MANA'T\nnone can ever give him whom You decide to deprive,\nوَلَا يَنْفَعُ ذَا الْجَدِّ مِنْكَ الْجَدُّ\nWA LAA YANFA'U DHAL JADDI MINKAL JADD\nand nothing can ever stop that which You decide.\nThen pass your hands over your face.",
    "Last Day of Rajab\nOn the last day of Rajab, offer the last ten units in the same way, two at a time.\nIn each unit, recite [Surah al-Fatihah](A5) once, [Surah al-Tawheed](A116) three times and [Surah al-Kafirun](A113) three times.\nAfter the taslim, raise your hands and recite these three litanies, in this order:\nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللّٰهُ وَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ\nLAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAHU WAHDAHOO LAA SHAREEKA LAH\nThere is no god save Allah, the One and Only Who has no partner.\nلَهُ الْمُلْكُ وَلَهُ الْحَمْدُ\nLAHUL MULKU WA LAHUL HAMD\nTo Him is the kingdom and to Him is all praise.\nيُحْيِيْ وَيُمِيْتُ وَهُوَ حَيٌّ لَا يَمُوْتُ\nYUHYEE WA YUMEETU WA HUWA HAYYUN LAA YAMOOT\nHe gives life and causes to die while He is Ever-living and never dies.\nبِيَدِهِ الْخَيْرُ وَهُوَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَيْ‏ءٍ قَدِيْرٌ\nBIYADIHIL KHAYRU WA HUWA A'LAA KULLI SHAY'IN QADEER\nIn His hand is the good and He has power over all things.\nوَصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهِ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ\nWA SALLALLAAHU A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALIHIT TAAHIREEN\nMay Allah send blessings to Muhammad and upon his Household, the Immaculate.\nوَلَا حَوْلَ وَلَا قُوَّةَ اِلَّا بِاللّٰهِ الْعَلِيِّ الْعَظِيْمِ\nWA LAA HAWLA WA LAA QUWWATA ILLAA BILLAAHIL A'LIYYIL A'ZEEM\nThere is neither might nor power save with Allah, the Most High, the All-great.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ لَا مَانِعَ لِمَا اَعْطَيْتَ\nALLAAHUMMA LAA MAANI'A LIMAA A'TAYT\nO Allah, verily, none can ever divest him whom You decide to give,\nوَلَا مُعْطِيَ لِمَا مَنَعْتَ\nWA LAA MU'TIYA LIMAA MANA'T\nnone can ever give him whom You decide to deprive,\nوَلَا يَنْفَعُ ذَا الْجَدِّ مِنْكَ الْجَدُّ\nWA LAA YANFA'U DHAL JADDI MINKAL JADD\nand nothing can ever stop that which You decide.\nThen pass your hands over your face and ask for what you need."
